+# testdata
+
+Two SEV-SNP attestation reports (version 5), byte for byte as real guests returned them through configfs-tsm on
+7 October 2026, each the report of the honest Enrollment Evidence (present-nonce) of an attestation-bench hardware
+run (`hwcheck/evidence/<run>/enroll-present-nonce/evidence.tsm.cbor`, its `outblob`).
+
+| file | sha256 | run | signed with | mitigation vectors (launch, current) |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `report-gcp-vcek-20261007T134801Z.bin` | `e00000cf1111812890b850d5a6c11663e382b741db39ae201c8859c5b5136702` | `20261007T134801Z-gcp-sev-snp`, Google Cloud n2d-standard-2 | the chip's VCEK (SIGNER_INFO 0x0) | 0xb, 0xb |
+| `report-aws-vlek-20261007T134512Z.bin` | `daca1c7bf8a347fa816e7d5389d2f086396be566ded1251f731d6c89564a568f` | `20261007T134512Z-aws-sev-snp`, AWS c6a.large | a VLEK (SIGNER_INFO 0x4) | 0x10f, 0x10f |
